; `task` declares `:done` and `:archived` as positional flags. A
; document that repeats a declared flag trips `duplicate_positional_flag`
; on the second occurrence — distinct from `not_flag_member` (an
; undeclared flag) and from the loader's `invalid_manifest` for a
; duplicate `(flag …)` declaration.
(plugin :name flag-set-test :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name task
    :positional (flag-set
      (flag :name done)
      (flag :name archived))))
